OL,3,GNEWSACounty leaders face pressure over
OL,4,Aclimate change
OL,5,
OL,6,FDerbyshire's Reform UK leaders have
OL,7,Ffaced criticism over their approach to
OL,8,Fclimate change after scrapping a key
OL,9,Fcouncil strategy on the issue.
OL,11,FCouncillors were met with protests
OL,12,Forganised by climate activists and a
OL,13,Fseries of public questions on
OL,14,Fenvironmental issues during a meeting
OL,15,Fof the full council on Wednesday.
OL,17,FThe Derbyshire Green Party
OL,18,Funsuccessfully tried to force the
OL,19,Fcouncil to rethink its strategy and
OL,20,F"include an unambiguous recognition of
OL,21,Fman-made climate change".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
