OL,3,GNEWSACounty leaders face pressure over
OL,4,Aclimate change
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil bosses said the new strategy is
OL,7,Fbased on "common sense" and Alan
OL,8,FGraves, leader of the authority, said
OL,9,Fin a BBC interview he does not believe
OL,10,Fclimate change is man-made.
